commit 65ce4acf80a835779a7cffd468faeaabfe875b62

C03: wallpaper, slide decks and contacts are known unsupported effects (LIMITS1665)

«cambiá el fondo de pantalla a azul», «Haz un powerpoint hablando de amor de 6 diapositivas», «agregá a Juan a mis contactos» and «guardá el contacto de …» ask for effects the catalog has no operation for (desktop wallpaper, slide-deck creation, an address book — the owner ruled a phone number is not something to store on the PC), so the model decided them with no reading. Three known_unsupported_effect_request contracts (desktop.wallpaper.set, document.presentation.create, contacts.add) now close the turn as a plain limit naming the request; they lift automatically if such an operation ever enters the catalog.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


